{"sourceUrl":"https://graduate.pumc.edu.cn/zsw/info/1013/2269.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:53.787068+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://graduate.pumc.edu.cn/zsw/info/1013/2269.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>中国医学科学院成立于</span><span>1956</span><span>年，北京协和医学院成立于</span><span>1917</span><span>年。自</span><span>1957</span><span>年起，中国医学科学院与北京协和医学院实行院校合一的管理体制。院校始终坚守初心使命，以引领我国医学科技教育发展、守护人民健康为己任，在教育领域人才辈出，在科研领域硕果累累，在医疗行业发挥领衔作用，为我国现代医学科学体系的建立与发展作出了重要贡献。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>北京协和医学院</span></span><span><span>临床医学专业培养模式改革试点班（简称</span></span><span><span>“协和医班（博士）”</span></span><span><span>）面向国内外高水平大学，招收学科基础扎实、热爱医学且个性心理特质适宜从医的优秀非医学专业本科毕业生，直接攻读临床医学博士学位。</span></span><span><span>协和</span></span><span><span>医</span></span><span><span>班</span></span><span><span>（博士）</span></span><span><span>以基础医学、临床医学为主干学科，采用</span><span>“器官</span><span>-</span><span>系统</span><span>-</span><span>功能”整合教学模式，实现基础课程与临床课程</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>深度融合；同时结合多科室见习、实习及专科轮转，全程开展思想政治教育、职业素养培育与学术能力培养，旨在造就具备多学科背景的高层次医学人才。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、招生类型</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>协和医</span></span><span><span>班</span></span><span><span>（博士）</span></span><span><span>项目招生类型为专业学位研究生，专业名称为临床医学，专业代码</span><span>105100</span><span>。学习方式为全日制，学制</span><span>4</span><span>年，最长学习年限可延长至</span><span>6</span><span>年。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、选拔方式</span></span><span><span>及招生计划</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>本次招生计划为</span></span><span><span>20-25</span></span><span><span>人，选拔方式</span></span><span><span>采用</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>申请</span>-<span>考核</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>制，</span></span><span><span>坚持</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>服务战略、</span></span><span><span>按需招生、全面衡量、择优录取</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>宁缺毋滥</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>原则</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>报考</span></span><span><span>条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）申请参加</span></span><span><span>协和</span></span><span><span>医</span></span><span><span>班</span></span><span><span>（博士）</span></span><span><span>项目选拔的人员，须</span></span><span><span>符合</span></span><span><span>以下条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>中华人民共和国公民</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>拥护中国共产党领导，拥护社会主义制度，</span></span><span><span>愿意为医药卫生事业服务，遵纪守法，品德端正</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span><span>本科</span></span><span><span>就读于国内一流大学建设高校（原一流大学建设高校</span><span>A</span><span>类，具体大学名单见附件</span><span>1</span><span>），具有推荐免试攻读研究生资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>本科</span></span><span><span>专业背景为</span></span><span><span>理</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>、工</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>、农</span></span><span><span>学门类</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>不包括医学门类各专业（含基础医学类、临床医学类、口腔医学类、公共卫生与预防医学类、中医学类、中西医结合类、药学类、中药学类、法医学类、医学技术类、护理学类等）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）申请人学业水平须符合</span></span><span><span>以下</span></span><span><span>条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>截至报名前，平均学分绩点（</span><span>GPA</span><span>）达到</span><span>3.6</span><span>及以上（以</span><span>4.0</span><span>为满分），且所有修读课程无不及格记录。</span></span><span><span>若本科院校未提供</span><span>GPA</span><span>计算，须提交由本科院校教务部门开具的成绩排名证明，要求总成绩排名在</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>前</span><span>10%</span><span>以内；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>申请人</span></span><span><span>入学</span></span><span><span>前须完成</span></span><span><span>本科阶段</span></span><span><span>医学预科相关课程修读，满足医学预科课程与学分要求，具体详见《北京协和医学院临床医学</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>培养模式改革试点班医学预科课程要求》（</span></span><span><span>简称</span><span>“医学预科课程”，见</span></span><span><span>附件</span><span>2</span><span>），</span></span><span><span>申请人</span></span><span><span>所有医学预科课程均须在本科院校</span></span><span><span>或全球排名前</span><span>50</span><span>名（以</span></span><span><span>近五年</span><span>QS</span></span><span> <span>/ </span></span><span><span>U.S.</span></span> <span><span>News</span><span>世界大学排名</span></span><span><span>为准）的国内高校修读</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）申请人英语水平须符合</span></span><span><span>以下</span></span><span><span>条件之一，并提供</span></span><span><span>近</span></span><span><span>五年内（</span><span>2021</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日及以后参加考试）的英语成绩证明：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>全国大学英语六级考试（</span><span>CET-6</span><span>）成绩</span></span><span><span>达到</span></span><span><span>550</span><span>分</span></span><span><span>及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.TOEFL</span><span>成绩达到</span><span>102</span><span>分及以上；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.IELTS<span>成绩</span></span><span><span>达到</span></span><span>7.5<span>分及以上。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>报考程序</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）网</span></span><span><span>络</span></span><span><span>报名</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人须通过</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>北京协和医学院接收</span>2027<span>年推荐免试研究生预报名系统</span></span><span><span>”（</span></span><span><span>简称</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免预报名系统</span></span><span><span>”，</span></span><span><span>网址：</span></span><span>https://yzbtm.pumc.edu.cn</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>进行报名并提交报考材料，推免预报名</span></span><span><span>系统开放时间</span></span><span><span>截</span></span><span><span>至</span>2026<span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span>日</span>1</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>:00</span><span><span>，具体注册报名、材料准备等相关要求详见</span></span><span><span>《</span></span><span><span>北京协和医学院关于接收</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试研究生预报名通知</span></span><span><span>》（链接：</span></span><span><span>http://graduate.pumc.edu.cn/zsw/info/1005/2263.htm</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>报名时</span><span>“申请类型”请选“推免博士”，“目标院系”请选“协和医班（博士）”。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>报考材料</span></span><span><span>补充</span></span><span><span>要求</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>请在规定时间内通过推免预报名系统上传报考材料（电子版或扫描件），无需提交纸质版材料。申请人上传文件后须仔细检查文件的完整性与准确性，相关材料内容由申请人自行负责。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>申请人须提交</span></span><span><span>专家推荐信</span>2<span>封</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>包括</span><span>1</span><span>名申请人的大学任课教师</span></span><span><span>（副教授</span></span><span><span>（或相当</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>及以上职称</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>，以及</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>名具有生物医学相关学科副教授（或相当）及以上职称的推荐人。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>推荐</span></span><span><span>信须</span></span><span><span>具体说明推荐人对申请人的了解情况及时间跨度，详细描述申请人在推荐人指导下的学习、实践过程与实际表现，并给出客观评价。推荐</span></span><span><span>信</span></span><span><span>须由推荐人亲笔签名。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人</span></span><span><span>请妥善保存推荐信原件，入学后交培养单位入人事档案保存</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>申请人须提交</span></span><span><span>个人陈述</span></span><span><span>1</span><span>份</span></span><span><span>，内容应包含以下方面：（</span><span>1</span><span>）思想政治水平；（</span><span>2</span><span>）外语水平；（</span><span>3</span><span>）个人学习与工作经历；（</span><span>4</span><span>）本科专业相关的科研经历；（</span><span>5</span><span>）志愿服务实践心得；（</span><span>6</span><span>）对临床医学专业的认知，以及对临床医学与其他学科交叉发展前景的理解；（</span><span>7</span><span>）自我评价（涵盖性格倾向、心理素质、团队合作能力、特长等）。个人陈述字数不超过</span><span>800</span><span>字。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span>.</span><span><span>申请</span></span><span><span>人</span></span><span><span>填写的科研经历（需附立项申报书、结题申报书、项目批复文件、研究资助官方邮件等材料）、公开刊物发表文章（需附期刊封面、目录及文章全文）、已取得的专利（需附专利证书）及其他研究成果，均须提供相关证明</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>申请</span></span><span><span>人</span></span><span><span>填写的在校荣誉均须提供获奖证书、奖学金证书或证明邮件等相关证明</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>申请人须提供</span></span><span><span>不少于</span><span>40</span><span>小时的医疗卫生机构志愿者服务经历证明及服务单位评价</span></span><span><span>，服务机构类型包括医院、社区卫生服务机构、医生诊所、康复医疗机构等；若</span></span><span><span>申请人报名时尚未完成志愿服务，可先提交志愿服务计划，入学前补</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>服务经历证明及服务单位评价。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.</span><span>若</span></span><span><span>申请人报名时未全部完成</span></span><span><span>医学预科课程修读</span></span><span><span>，须</span></span><span><span>先</span></span><span><span>提交修</span></span><span><span>读</span></span><span><span>计划</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>入学前补</span></span><span><span>提交</span></span><span><span>医学预科课程</span></span><span><span>成绩单</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）</span></span><span><span>材料审核及复试名单确定</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>招生就业处依据申请人提交的材料，对其报考资格进行审查；对于符合报考要求且材料齐全的申请人，将其材料提交至专家</span></span><span><span>组</span></span><span><span>审核。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>专家组对申请人提交的报考材料</span></span><span><span>进行综合评估</span></span><span><span>，结合招生计划</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>按照</span></span><span><span>不低于</span><span>1:1.2</span></span><span><span>比例择优</span></span><span><span>确定</span></span><span><span>复试名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、复试与录取</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）复试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试预计于</span><span>9</span><span>月上旬进行，分为两个阶段：第一阶段为医学预科笔试；第二阶段为专家组面试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>所有进入复试的申请人参加复试时</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>须提交</span></span><span><span>与网络报名材料一致的全套报考材料供复试工作人员核验，具体包括：</span></span><span><span>身份证明、学生证、成绩单原件、英语水平成绩单原件、荣誉</span></span><span><span>证明</span></span><span><span>原件、科研经历证明原件、志愿者</span></span><span><span>服务</span></span><span><span>证明原件</span></span><span><span>等。</span></span><span><span>材料不符合规定的，不予复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>医学预科笔试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>笔试内容主要包括：</span></span><span><span>生物学（生物化学、分子生物学、细胞生物学、遗传学等）、化学（无机化学</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>有机化学</span></span><span><span>等</span></span><span><span>）、大学数学（高等数学、统计学等）、大学物理（力学、热学、电磁学、光学等）、医学人文类科目（医学史、医学人文、生命伦理学、卫生政策、心理学、医学英语等）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>医学预科</span></span><span><span>笔试的命题工作委托国家医学考试中心负责，</span></span><span><span>题型</span></span><span><span>包括单项选择题、多项选择题、简答题</span></span><span><span>等。</span></span><span><span>笔试时长</span><span>210</span><span>分钟，满分</span><span>100</span><span>分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>根据考生笔试成绩，择优遴选考生进入第二阶段专家组面试。笔试成绩低于</span><span>60</span><span>分者不得进入第二阶段考核。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>专家组面试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>主要考察申请人的思想品德、本科阶段个人情况及学习经历、思想敏锐度与逻辑思维能力、学术</span></span><span><span>思维</span></span><span><span>与学习能力、科研素养、医学职业适应性以及沟通交流能力等方面。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>时</span></span><span><span>申请人</span></span><span><span>须进行</span><span>5</span><span>分钟个人</span></span><span><span>汇报</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>需准备</span><span>PPT</span><span>，由申请人在</span></span><span><span>面</span></span><span><span>试前自行完成）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>汇报内容须包括</span></span><span><span>：（</span><span>1</span><span>）个人基本情况及学习、工作经历（以英文表述）；（</span><span>2</span><span>）本科阶段的科研经历；（</span><span>3</span><span>）志愿服务实践心得；（</span><span>4</span><span>）对临床医学专业的认识与理解，以及对临床医学与其他学科交叉前景的思考；（</span><span>5</span><span>）自我评价（包括性格倾向、心理素质、团队合作能力及特长等方面）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）录取</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>按照复试总成绩排序结合招生计划择优确定拟录取名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试总成绩满分为</span><span>100</span><span>分，由申请人医学预科笔试成绩（按满分</span><span>50</span><span>分折算）、专家组面试成绩（按满分</span><span>50</span><span>分折算）构成。复试总成绩低于</span><span>60</span><span>分者、复试任一阶段成绩低于</span><span>60</span><span>分者均不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>信息</span></span><span><span>查询</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一）</span></span><span>2026<span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>下</span></span><span><span>旬</span></span><span><span>查询复试工作方案。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二）</span></span><span>2026<span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>上旬</span></span><span><span>查询复试名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七</span></span><span><span>、学费收费</span></span><span><span>及奖助贷情况</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>标准：</span></span><span><span>协和</span></span><span><span>医</span></span><span><span>班</span></span><span><span>（博士）</span></span><span><span>项目学费收费标准为第</span><span>1-2</span><span>学年</span><span>8000</span><span>元（人民币）</span><span>/</span><span>学年、第</span><span>3-4</span><span>学年及之后</span><span>10000</span><span>元（人民币）</span><span>/</span><span>学年；住宿费为</span><span>750</span><span>元（人民币）</span><span>/</span><span>学年。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我校为</span></span><span><span>协和</span></span><span><span>医</span></span><span><span>班</span></span><span><span>（博士）</span></span><span><span>学生提供基本助学金及各类奖助学金；家庭经济困难的学生除可申请各项奖助学金外，还可申请国家助学贷款及临时困难补助。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>八、</span></span><span><span>联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地址：北京市东城区东单三条</span>9<span>号</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮编：</span>100730</span></p>\n<p><span><span>部门：北京协和医学院招生就业处</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮箱：</span>mdadmission@pumc.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span><span>招生咨询电话：</span>010-65105672/6510</span><span><span>5774/65105828</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>纪检监督电话：</span>010-65105666</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（工作日</span> 9:00-11:00<span>，</span><span>14:00-16:00</span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>九</span></span><span><span>、其他</span></span><span><span>说明</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>按照《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》，除患有学校可以不予录取的疾病外，有下列情况之一者，不能被医学类各专业录取：色弱、色盲及其他各类不能准确识别颜色者。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>按照《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》，有下列情况之一者，不宜就读医学类各专业，请申请人谨慎报考：任何一眼矫正到</span>4.8<span>镜片度数大于</span><span>800</span><span>度者；一眼失明另一眼矫正到</span><span>4.8</span><span>镜片度数大于</span><span>400</span><span>度者；两耳听力均在</span><span>3</span><span>米以内，或一耳听力在</span><span>5</span><span>米另一耳全聋者；斜视、嗅觉迟钝、口吃者；对化学物品有过敏反应者。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>申请人须承诺所有</span></span><span><span>报考</span></span><span><span>材料真实有效，如经查证出现不实材料，即取消报名及录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>港澳台地区申请人的基本报考条件、提交材料与内地申请人相同。录取方式均为全日制研究生，学费参照学校研究生的学费标准收取。入学后待遇与内地申请人相同。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>如遇上级部门在</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年招生年度出台新的招生政策，我校将</span></span><span><span>作</span></span><span><span>相应调整，并</span></span><span><span>实时公布。</span></span></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"d4c452e217b9cf1b3ba0c385be6cb150c1bc9f8eb06f1a2a901ef279d155fb05","textLength":3880,"sourceSha256":"251f1d902e06b524b72b3f82fb5aeb33b19d40689ec56395d54e2d3a1c18740f","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1.一流大学建设高校名单.pdf","url":"https://graduate.pumc.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1653377925&wbfileid=4597583"},{"name":"附件2.北京协和医学院临床医学专业培养模式改革试点班医学预科课程要求.pdf","url":"https://graduate.pumc.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1653377925&wbfileid=4597584"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-64ee73c749fa49753fd5","title":"2026年北京协和医学院2027年临床医学专业培养模式改革试点班推免招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:53.787068+00:00"}
